# Test your FastAPI endpoints

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/hello/User
Accept: application/json

###
# 测试列出产品
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/products?category=life
Accept: application/json

###
# 测试列出推荐候选产品
GET http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/products/candidates?categories=life&premium_min=100000&limit_per_category=3
Accept: application/json

### 测试添加会话
POST http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/chat-threads
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试会话"
}

### 测试重命名会话（thread_id 换成实际值）
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8001/api/v1/chat-threads/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
x-user-id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "重命名后的标题"
}


